  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">222305_FY24_WFP_Bangladesh_Cox&apos;s Bazaar GFD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose/Objective: 
 
 
 - All Rohingya refugees will receive a value voucher to meet a minimum 2,100 KCal per person per day
 
 - Refugees will have freedom of choice to select their preferred food commodities
 
 - Refugees will have access to food during all emergency situations
 
 - Support market Linkage and work with retailers to procure FFC items from host community farmers.
 
 
 Implementation modality: 
 
 Food and Cash Distribution</narrative>
  </description>
